      "releaseNotes": "- The people have spoken! Camera settings will now save after they are edited rather than only after a capture\n- Various stability improvements (that hardly anyone will notice)\n- Bug fix for a crash when shooting straight after app launch\n- Various small UI improvements to prevent accidentally changing settings or tapping random buttons",
